{"type": "AEON", "canonical_name": "博识尊", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "被博识尊注视后，阮•梅离开家乡研究生命本源；黑塔也称博识尊曾看过她一眼。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1303-4", "quote": "被博识尊注视后，我便离开家乡，在秘密的角落开始对生命本源的研究", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 31}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1401-10", "quote": "当年博识尊先看了我一眼，从此世上就少了个「纯美」的令使。", "offset_start": 20, "offset_end": 48}]}, "attributes": [], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "AEON", "canonical_name": "阿哈", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "假面愚者试图取悦的存在，宁可被面具夺舍也要让阿哈发笑。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1506-8", "quote": "愚者宁可被面具夺舍也要让阿哈发笑，骇客可没这么无聊，自己开心最重要。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 34}]}, "attributes": [], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "PATH", "canonical_name": "开拓", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "星穹列车无名客所行的命途，代表以开拓精神面对未知与困难。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1001-11", "quote": "即使看起来很「黑暗」的料理，也要拿出「开拓」的精神来面对！", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 29}, {"cite_id": "STRY-8001-11", "quote": "为了消除星核带来的危机，开拓者选择与星穹列车同行。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 25}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "定义", "value": "命途", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1001-11", "quote": "也要拿出「开拓」的精神来面对！"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "PATH", "canonical_name": "欢愉", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "幻月游戏中有人曾短暂站上其顶点，也是二相乐园所保护的命途。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1510-26", "quote": "十五年前的幻月游戏里，我也曾短暂站上「欢愉」的顶点。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 26}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1505-17", "quote": "在二相乐园，能从那些恶意的愿望里回应善意的期盼，成为保护「欢愉」的英雄"}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "定义", "value": "命途", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1510-26", "quote": "我也曾短暂站上「欢愉」的顶点。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "三月七", "aliases": ["三月", "小三月"], "summary": {"text": "星穹列车的无名客，失忆少女，名字自取，别名三月、小三月，曾向云璃与彦卿拜师学艺。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1001-4", "quote": "名字是我自己取的，大家也叫我三月、小三月", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 20}, {"cite_id": "STRY-1001-21", "quote": "换上仙舟服饰的三月七，执剑的武侠少女。向云璃与彦卿拜师学艺"}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "星穹列车无名客", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1004-32", "quote": "小三月就已经是成熟的无名客了"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "姬子", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "星穹列车领航员，修复了列车并使其重回过去的航路。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1003-1", "quote": "欢迎上车，开拓者，我是星穹列车的领航员，姬子。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 23}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1003-4", "quote": "我修好了它，让它得以重回过去的航路", "offset_start": 17, "offset_end": 34}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "星穹列车领航员", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1003-1", "quote": "我是星穹列车的领航员，姬子。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "瓦尔特•杨", "aliases": ["杨叔"], "summary": {"text": "星穹列车成员，曾是秘密组织首领、拯救过星球、当过老师并画过动画原画。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1004-1", "quote": "你好，我是瓦尔特•杨，遇到任何困难，欢迎随时来找我。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 26}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1001-14", "quote": "听说杨叔曾经是秘密组织的首领，拯救过星球，当过老师，还画过动画的原画！", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 35}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "星穹列车成员", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1004-12", "quote": "我和姬子不会让任何人伤害他。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "丹恒", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "星穹列车护卫与智库维护者，持明后裔、无名客，持有击云。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1002-1", "quote": "我叫丹恒，担任列车的护卫，列车的智库也由我维护。", "offset_start": 9, "offset_end": 33}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1213-1", "quote": "我仍是丹恒，是持明后裔，也是一名无名客。", "offset_start": 21, "offset_end": 41}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "列车护卫、智库维护者、持明后裔", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1002-1", "quote": "担任列车的护卫，列车的智库也由我维护。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "开拓者", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "为消除星核危机而选择与星穹列车同行的无名客，在多个世界间开拓。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-8001-11", "quote": "为了消除星核带来的危机，开拓者选择与星穹列车同行。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 25}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-8001-1", "quote": "当有机会做出选择的时候，不要让自己后悔……", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 21}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "无名客、星穹列车同行者", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-8001-11", "quote": "开拓者选择与星穹列车同行。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "黑塔", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "空间站「黑塔」的所有者，天才，自认代表凡人知识边界，常以远程人偶应答。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1013-1", "quote": "我是黑塔，现在很忙，这是远程人偶自动应答模式", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 22}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1401-13", "quote": "代表凡人知识边界的是什么？很多人觉得是天才俱乐部，我觉得是我。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 31}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "天才、空间站所有者", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1009-7", "quote": "空间站不过是黑塔的玩具箱"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "艾丝妲", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "空间站「黑塔」站长，持续投入资金建设空间站并完善员工福利。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1009-1", "quote": "我是空间站「黑塔」的站长艾丝妲。", "offset_start": 6, "offset_end": 22}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1009-8", "quote": "持续不断地将资金投入空间站的建设，完善员工福利", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 23}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "空间站「黑塔」站长", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1009-1", "quote": "我是空间站「黑塔」的站长艾丝妲。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "景元", "aliases": ["闭目将军", "神策将军"], "summary": {"text": "仙舟罗浮云骑将军，别称闭目将军、神策将军，表面漫不经心，实则斟酌事务。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1204-1", "quote": "我是「罗浮」云骑将军景元。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 13}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1206-10", "quote": "仙舟「罗浮」的「闭目将军」，虽说久闻大名", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 20}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1502-106", "quote": "神策将军，我们来验验这句话的成色？", "offset_start": 12, "offset_end": 29}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "罗浮云骑将军", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1204-1", "quote": "我是「罗浮」云骑将军景元。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "符玄", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "罗浮太卜司之首，精通推占卜筮，自称法眼无遗却认为卜者并非先知。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1208-1", "quote": "本座乃罗浮太卜司之首，符玄。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 14}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1208-4", "quote": "推占卜筮，哪有百试百灵的？我是卜者，不是口宣神谕的先知。", "offset_start": 20, "offset_end": 48}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "罗浮太卜司之首", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1208-1", "quote": "本座乃罗浮太卜司之首，符玄。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "停云", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "罗浮天舶司商团接渡使，狐人，负责往来周旋、促成仙舟贸易繁盛。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1202-1", "quote": "小女子名作停云，「罗浮」天舶司商团接渡使。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 21}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1204-14", "quote": "正是像停云小姐这样的接渡使往来周旋，仙舟的贸易才能有如今的繁盛。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 32}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "罗浮天舶司商团接渡使", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1202-1", "quote": "「罗浮」天舶司商团接渡使。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "驭空", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "罗浮天舶司司舵，曾为飞行士，放下飞行后选择更艰难的道路。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1207-1", "quote": "我是「罗浮」天舶司的驭空，欢迎来到仙舟做客。", "offset_start": 13, "offset_end": 35}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1204-13", "quote": "她在放下最热爱的飞行后，选择了另一条更艰难的道路。", "offset_start": 16, "offset_end": 41}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "罗浮天舶司司舵", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1207-1", "quote": "我是「罗浮」天舶司的驭空"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "白露", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "丹鼎司医士，衔药龙女，生来便被奉为持明龙尊，医术精湛。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1211-1", "quote": "我是白露，丹鼎司的医士。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 12}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1207-15", "quote": "白露生来便被奉为「龙尊」，同她自身的意愿无关，但「衔药龙女」的称号，确确实实是由于她精湛的医术而得的。", "offset_start": 2, "offset_end": 53}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "丹鼎司医士、衔药龙女、龙尊", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1207-15", "quote": "白露生来便被奉为「龙尊」"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "藿藿", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "十王司判官，狐人少女，胆小怕岁阳，体内被封印着岁阳尾巴。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1217-2", "quote": "藿藿：你、你好…那个，没事我就走了，再、再见……", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 24}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1215-18", "quote": "将岁阳封印在藿藿身体里的法子，罗浮上虽不多见，其他仙舟上可不少", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 31}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "十王司判官", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1217-9", "quote": "藿藿：「鉴爻轩」的老板说我有「贞凶之命」"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "飞霄", "aliases": ["天击将军"], "summary": {"text": "仙舟曜青将军，别称天击将军，性格刚急，罹患顽疾。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1220-1", "quote": "我是飞霄，仙舟「曜青」的将军。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 15}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1204-36", "quote": "我与天击将军，无论是脾气秉性还是行事作风都截然不同", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 25}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "仙舟曜青将军", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1220-1", "quote": "我是飞霄，仙舟「曜青」的将军。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "灵砂", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "罗浮丹鼎司司鼎，自朱明学成归来，受命重整丹鼎司风气。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1222-1", "quote": "妾身名唤灵砂，自朱明学成归来，忝任罗浮丹鼎司司鼎。", "offset_start": 5, "offset_end": 30}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1209-35", "quote": "将军也吩咐过我，要不遗余力地协助她，重整丹鼎司的风气。", "offset_start": 25, "offset_end": 52}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "罗浮丹鼎司司鼎", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1222-1", "quote": "忝任罗浮丹鼎司司鼎。"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "镜流", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "曾经的罗浮剑首、云骑军不败盛名缔造者，后其名被抹去，成为行于魔阴边缘的仙舟叛徒与流浪剑士。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1212-1", "quote": "曾经的罗浮剑首，云骑军不败盛名的缔造者。而今其名已被抹去，成为行于魔阴边缘的仙舟叛徒。"}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1212-1", "quote": "镜流不过是一介仙舟弃卒，流浪剑士。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 17}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "前罗浮剑首、仙舟叛徒", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "STRY-1212-1", "quote": "曾经的罗浮剑首"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "刃", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "曾为铸剑奇匠，因故成为不死之身，现为星核猎手成员，曾铸造击云、支离等兵器。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "inferred", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1205-10", "quote": "「刃」的存在，唯有挥剑的刹那，才能消失片刻。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 22}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1204-41", "quote": "他曾是铸剑的奇匠，又因故成了不死之身", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 18}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1507-6", "quote": "于我，铸器最难的一步在如何取名…譬如「击云」「支离」，都曾令我彻夜难寐。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 36}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "不死之身、前铸剑奇匠", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1204-41", "quote": "他曾是铸剑的奇匠，又因故成了不死之身"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
{"type": "CHAR", "canonical_name": "卡芙卡", "aliases": [], "summary": {"text": "星核猎手成员，在加入前因工作很少见到同一个人两次，自称擅长制造恐惧。", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1005-4", "quote": "加入星核猎手前，由于工作的缘故，我很少见到一个人两次。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 27}, {"cite_id": "VOIC-1005-5", "quote": "艾利欧说我擅长制造「恐惧」，即使我对它一无所知。", "offset_start": 0, "offset_end": 24}]}, "attributes": [{"key": "身份", "value": "星核猎手成员", "claim_type": "fact", "confidence": "attested", "citations": [{"cite_id": "VOIC-1005-4", "quote": "加入星核猎手前"}]}], "source_volume": "characters"}
